At the time of my inspection, the mitigation repairs were in the process of completion. A significant amount of mitigation had been
completed. Some photographs were provided as to the pre-existing conditions/materials and the estimate was also provided.
However, Tri-Tech Restoration will not be responsible for any misidentified items, missing repair items, any analysis of the damages
or materials, material pricing or any missing items related to unforeseen conditions or county building department requirements. In
order to facilitate this estimate, repair line items were added/modified to a previous estimate so that continuity could be provided.
No observations or comments were made in regards to any mitigation or temporary services. All personal property repairs are
excluded. All AV and alarm/security inspections and repairs are also excluded.
All waterproofing issues are excluded from this estimate.
This is a preliminary estimate as there are several inspection reports pending.
